ok insert reports one change
ok last_insert_rowid is the new id
ok text with a quote and unicode round-trips
ok 10 KB text round-trips
ok text read in a block outlives the statement
ok int reads an INTEGER column
ok float reads a REAL column
ok null? sees NULL
ok text reads NULL as empty
ok text_or_nil reads NULL as nil
ok int_or_nil reads a value
ok int_or_nil reads NULL as nil
ok float_or_nil reads NULL as nil
ok update reports every changed row
ok a syntax error raises Kilau::DB::Error
ok too many binds raise Kilau::DB::Error
ok a NOT NULL violation raises Kilau::DB::Error
ok a NUL byte in text raises instead of truncating
ok an unbindable value raises
ok an exception in the query block propagates
ok the connection still works after it
ok opening in a missing directory raises Kilau::DB::Error
